{
  "_comment": [
    "Twenty-one cards, chosen so every bug class the corpus sweep hunts is present in a catalog small enough to reason about by hand.",
    "mtg: a hyphen-and-accent name, a prefix-sibling pair, and the collector number the padded/unpadded contrast is drawn on.",
    "pokemon: the Krookodile suffix pair, the hyphenated Tauros-GX, a Rayquaza V pair, the Darkrai/Mega trio, a zero-padded number, a lettered number (SL5).",
    "yugioh: a hyphenated name; one card printed both as IOC-EN017 and IOC-017 — the pair sameCardCode deliberately treats as one; and Gradius, whose Pharaoh's Servant rows are three regions of one number plus PSV-EN089 listed twice at two rarities (the residual no printed code can resolve)."
  ],
